{"step_index":264,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-13T06:26:34Z","input_tokens":5652,"cache_read_tokens":142093,"output_tokens":1970,"content":"The entire first **end-to-end Kezza business journey** is now fully built, integrated, tested, and committed to Git.\n\nThe complete architectural roadmap is documented in [kezza-roadmap.md](file:///Users/ravi/.gemini/antigravity/brain/ac874d6b-66a8-4909-bd09-41bc366cbb15/kezza-roadmap.md).\n\n---\n\n## 🏆 The Complete 7-Step Journey in Action\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n  autonumber\n  actor Agent as 🏷️ Agent\n  actor Patient as 🏥 Patient\n  participant App as Kezza Mobile App\n  participant API as FastAPI Backend\n  participant DB as Database (Postgres / SQLite)\n\n  Agent->>App: Logs in & requests referral code\n  App->>API: GET /api/v1/referrals/my-code\n  API-->>App: AGT-XXXXXX & kezzamobile://register?ref=AGT-XXXXXX\n  Agent->>Patient: Shares referral link\n\n  Patient->>App: Opens link & registers with mobile\n  App->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/register (referral_code=AGT-XXXXXX)\n  API->>DB: Locks Referral Attribution (status: registered)\n  API-->>App: Patient JWT + Profile\n\n  Patient->>App: Purchases treatment (e.g. Teeth Whitening R 1,500)\n  App->>API: POST /api/v1/payments/purchase-treatment\n  API->>DB: Records verified Payment (status: verified)\n  API->>DB: Credits PointsLedger (+150 pts = R150 credit)\n  API->>DB: Converts Referral & Records CommissionLedger (+R150 commission)\n  API-->>App: Reward & Commission confirmed\n\n  Patient->>App: Views Wallet (GET /api/v1/wallet/patient)\n  App-->>Patient: Shows 150 pts (R 150.00 treatment credit)\n\n  Agent->>App: Views Earnings (GET /api/v1/wallet/agent)\n  App-->>Agent: Shows R 150.00 approved commission & converted patient\n```\n\n---\n\n## 🛠️ What Was Built\n\n### 1. Database & Models (Phase 2)\nAdded the remaining business tables and generated Alembic migration `a89c31bdf721`:\n* **`payments`**: Records clinic transactions with payment references, amounts (stored in cents), currency (`ZAR`), and verification timestamps.\n* **`points_ledger`**: Patient reward ledger with earn/redeem event types, point amounts, and running balances.\n* **`commission_tiers`** & **`commission_ledger`**: Agent tier configuration and commission records with approved/pending/paid lifecycle states.\n* **`otp_requests`**: OTP verification records with expiration and verification status.\n\n### 2. Backend Services & REST APIs\n* **`POST /api/v1/auth/otp/request` & `verify`**: 6-digit OTP verification with standard development test code (`123456`).\n* **`POST /api/v1/auth/register`**: Patient & Agent registration with **automatic referral attribution locking**.\n* **`GET /api/v1/referrals/my-code`**: Retrieves agent referral code (e.g. `AGT-871B20`), deep link, and conversion counts.\n* **`POST /api/v1/referrals/lead`**: Allows agents to pre-register patient leads with duplicate-phone prevention.\n* **`POST /api/v1/payments/purchase-treatment`**: Records verified payments, immediately calculates 10% patient points reward (1 pt per R10 spent), converts the referral, and credits 10% commission to the referring agent.\n* **`GET /api/v1/wallet/patient`**: Patient treatment credit wallet and transaction history.\n* **`GET /api/v1/wallet/agent`**: Agent commission breakdown (Approved, Pending, Paid) and ledger history.\n\n### 3. Automated End-to-End Test Suite\nCreated and ran [`backend/app/tests/test_journey.py`](file:///Users/ravi/Desktop/Kezza_mobile-main/backend/app/tests/test_journey.py) which executes the complete 7-step journey programmatically:\n```\nINFO: HTTP Request: POST http://testserver/api/v1/auth/register \"HTTP/1.1 200 OK\"\nINFO: HTTP Request: GET http://testserver/api/v1/referrals/my-code \"HTTP/1.1 200 OK\"\nINFO: HTTP Request: POST http://testserver/api/v1/auth/register \"HTTP/1.1 200 OK\"\nINFO: HTTP Request: GET http://testserver/api/v1/referrals/patient-attribution \"HTTP/1.1 200 OK\"\nINFO: HTTP Request: GET http://testserver/api/v1/referrals \"HTTP/1.1 200 OK\"\nINFO: HTTP Request: POST http://testserver/api/v1/payments/purchase-treatment \"HTTP/1.1 200 OK\"\nINFO: HTTP Request: GET http://testserver/api/v1/wallet/patient \"HTTP/1.1 200 OK\"\nINFO: HTTP Request: GET http://testserver/api/v1/wallet/agent \"HTTP/1.1 200 OK\"\nALL 7 MVP JOURNEY TESTS PASSED!\n```\n\n### 4. Interactive Mobile App (Expo / React Native)\n* **Auth Screens (`login.tsx`, `verify-otp.tsx`)**: Phone number login, referral code auto-detection from links, OTP verification, and inline role selection.\n* **Dashboard Tab (`index.tsx`)**:\n  * **Agent view**: Agent Code card, one-tap \"Copy Referral Link\", and summary metrics.\n  * **Patient view**: Treatment credit card and a **Live Treatment Purchase Simulator** (e.g. *Teeth Whitening — R 1,500*) allowing anyone running the app to trigger a live payment and watch reward points and agent commissions update in real time.\n* **Referrals Tab (`referrals.tsx`)**: Agent referral pipeline list with colored status tags (`Registered`, `Contacted`, `✓ Converted`), lead creation form, and patient attribution status.\n* **Wallet Tab (`wallet.tsx`)**: Live patient points ledger (1 pt = R1 credit) and agent commission earnings breakdown.\n* **Profile Screen (`profile.tsx`)**: Account details, sign out, and a **Role-Switching Demo Helper** to easily test both Agent and Patient experiences on the same device.\n\n---\n\n## 🚀 How to Run and Test\n\n### 1. Start the Backend API\n```bash\ncd /Users/ravi/Desktop/Kezza_mobile-main/backend\n.venv/bin/python -m uvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 8000\n```\nInteractive API docs are available at `http://localhost:8000/docs`.\n\n### 2. Run the Automated Journey Test\n```bash\ncd /Users/ravi/Desktop/Kezza_mobile-main/backend\n.venv/bin/python -c \"\nimport os\nos.environ['DATABASE_URL'] = 'sqlite:///:memory:'\nfrom app.tests.conftest import test_engine, TestingSessionLocal\nfrom app.base import Base\nimport app.models\nBase.metadata.create_all(bind=test_engine)\nfrom fastapi.testclient import TestClient\nfrom app.main import app\nfrom app.database import get_db\nconn = test_engine.connect()\nsess = TestingSessionLocal(bind=conn)\napp.dependency_overrides[get_db] = lambda: sess\nclient = TestClient(app)\nfrom app.tests.test_journey import test_complete_kezza_journey\ntest_complete_kezza_journey(client)\nprint('✅ ALL 7 STEPS VERIFIED!')\n\"\n```\n\n### 3. Start the Mobile App\n```bash\ncd /Users/ravi/Desktop/Kezza_mobile-main\nnpm install\nnpx expo start\n```\n* Use code **`123456`** on the OTP screen to log in or register.\n* On the **Home** tab, tap any treatment in the simulator to test the rewards and commission calculations live!"}
